  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕;\"><!--[endif]-->&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">EBS</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">에서 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">악기란 무엇인가</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">라는 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">부작 다큐를 만들었는데요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이제야 다시 제대로 봤어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">악기 수업 시간에 활용하려고 적으면서 봤더니</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">과학 샘들께도 많은 도움이 될 것 같더라고요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이미 보신 분들도 많으실 거예요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. ^^;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">저는 수업 시간에 아이들한테 질문을 많이 하는 편인데요^^;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이 다큐를 보면서도 아이들에게 하고 싶은 질문이 많이 생기더라고요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그래서 함께 나누고자 합니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/26684D48557702B830\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"301\" height=\"183\" style=\"width: 301px; height: 183px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"EBS 다큐 프라임.140915.악기는 무엇으로 사는가 1부 악기들의 무덤.HDTV.X264.720p-BarosG.avi_000480547.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_26684D48557702B83063C5\"/><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24314E50557703F420\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"238\" height=\"183\" style=\"width: 238px; height: 183px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"EBS 다큐 프라임.140915.악기는 무엇으로 사는가 1부 악기들의 무덤.HDTV.X264.720p-BarosG.avi_001787153.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\"  id=\"A_24314E50557703F4207670\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">저는 대학 때 예술가이기를 바라는 교수님들 덕분에 굉장히 힘들었던 기억이 있어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">제가 아는 음악은 여러분과 마찬가지로 듣기 좋은 음악</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">들을만한 음악이었는데 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">대학에 가니 자신만의 음악을 만들기를 바라시더라고요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">덕분에 어떻게 하면 다른 소리를 낼까</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">어떻게 하면 내가 표현하고자 하는 것을 소리로 만들어 낼까에 관해 많은 고민을 했던 것 같아요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그런 훈련이 전혀 되어 있지 않은 상황이라 답답하고 많이 힘들었어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">특히 무엇보다도 기본이 제대로 되어 있지 않았어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">예를 들면 바이올린 곡을 써야 하는데 바이올린을 연주해 본 적이 없는 거죠</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">단지 머릿속으로 현이 낼 수 있는 음</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">가능한 음역</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">연주 가능한 중음 등</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이론으로 무장한 채 머리로 곡을 썼으니까요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">제가 이 다큐멘터리를 그때 봤다면 악기들이 어떻게 소리를 내는지</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">악기를 좀 더 잘 이해하고 곡을 썼을 것 같아요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그리고 아이들에게 악기를 소개할 때 좀 더 호기심을 갖게 할 수 있었을 것 같아요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">아이들에게 보여줄 때는 필요한 부분만 잘라 보여줘야 할 것 같네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">전문적이에요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">^^;;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\"><strong>혹시 그랜드 피아노 속을 들여다본 적 있으신가요</strong></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>?</strong> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">저는 이전 학교에 그랜드 피아노가 있어서 아이들과 자주 들여다봤어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그랜드 피아노가 학교에 있다는 것은 큰 행운이에요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">특히 현의 길이와 음높이를 설명할 때 편해요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그랜드 피아노 모양 자체가 낮은음은 길고 높은 음은 짧잖아요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그러니 같은 시간 동안 현의 길이가 짧아 진동이 빠른 높은음들은 당연히 높은음이 나는 거고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">주파수 이야기도 곁들이고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">아이들은 각각의 건반이 현 세 개로 이루어져 있다는 사실부터 신기해해요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">뎀퍼 페달</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">소리를 울리게 하는</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">을 밟고 낮은 현을 긁으면 정말 무시무시한 소리가 나죠</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">현 위에 종이를 올려놓고 건반을 연주하며 팝콘 튀기는 피아노 소리를 들어보기도 하고요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">....</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">부드러운 말렛</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">타악기를 연주하는 채</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">으로 현을 살짝 두드려 소리를 내보기도 하면서 아이들은 피아노에 매력을 느끼기 시작해요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">물론 피아노를 이렇게 계속 다루면 쉽게 망가지니 최대한 조심해서</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">......^^;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이 다큐에서는 피아노 속을 정말 자세히 들여다 볼 수 있게 해줘요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\"><strong>혹시 존 케이지를 아시나요</strong></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>?^^;</strong> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">분</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">33</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">초 동안 아무 연주를 하지 않은</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그런 존 케이지가 피아노 현 사이에 볼트와 못 등 여러 가지 재료들을 끼워 다양한 음색의 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">prepared piano</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">를 만들어 연주했어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그런 프리페어드 피아노곡을 감상하며 직접 그랜드 피아노 내부를 보고, 이해하고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">소리를 들어보고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그런 수업이 가능했었는데</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">지금은 업라이트 피아노라 불가능하네요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">^^ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">만약 학교에 그랜드 피아노가 있고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">음악샘과 친하시다면 다큐를 보시고 직접 확인하셔도 좋을 것 같아요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">^^ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">과학에서는 소리의 맵시가 있죠</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?^^ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">저는 그걸 음색이라고 배웠는데요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">혹시 서로 다른 것인가요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?^^;; 이 다큐를 보고 나면 악기들이 왜 음색이 다른지 이해가 되거든요.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">다큐멘터리를 메모하면서 보니 생각할 것들이 많았어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">아이들과</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그리고 과학 샘들과 함께 나누고 싶은 내용입니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">언플러그드</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(Unplugged)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">악기</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">플러그드</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(Plugged)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">악기</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">소리란 무엇인가</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">진동이란</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">장력이란</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">진동수란</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">공명체란</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">악기의 정의는</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">피아노는 타악기인가</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">현악기인가</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">미래에 피아니스트는 존재할까</span></strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>?</strong> </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">피아니스트가 사라진다면 이유는</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">남아있다면 이유는</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? : </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">저 같으면 남아 있을 것 같아요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">피아노를 복원한 장인의 이야기를 듣고 보니 그럴 것 같다는 생각이 들었어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이 다큐의 피디님과 작가님은 정말 예술적이고 문학적이시더라고요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">인상 깊은 자막 정지화면을 보여주고 아이들한테 해석을 부탁할래요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.^^ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">예를 들면</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span>&nbsp;<strong>* </strong></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\"><strong>악기는 공기를 흔들어야 악기다</strong></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.=&gt; 이 가설이 미래에까지 유효할까요?^^;;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;*</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">악기는 진동하지 않으면 악기가 아니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">*</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">피아노는 신을 위하던 시대에 태어나 인간을 말하는 시대의 주인공이 됨 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\"></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">*</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">소리 완성의 방점은 사운드포스트다 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\"></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>*</strong></span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\"><strong>미세한 진동이 폭풍이 되어 세상을 울린다</strong> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\"></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">*</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">파손된 악기 <strong>복원 장인들은 악기의 진동을 되찾아 주는 일을 한다</strong></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>.</strong> </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">등등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">장인은 어떤 사람인가</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?(</span></strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">좋은 소리를 만들고 좋은 악기를 만들어 연주자가 편하게 연주하고 청중한테 아름다운 음악으로 전달되는 것이 장인의 비전이라고 피아노 복원 장인이 다큐 끝에 말해요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.) </span><strong><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">나는 나의 삶에 어떤 장인이 되고 싶은가</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">이 다큐의 피디와 작가는 어떤 사람일까</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">왜 이 다큐를 만들었을까</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">필요한 자질은 무엇일까</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?</span></strong></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">9. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">피아노</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">바이올린</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">호른</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">전자 기타</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">콘트라베이스를 복원하는데요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">복원하면서 각 악기의 소리 발생과 공명에 대해 그래픽으로 보여줘요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">정말 잘 만들었더라고요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\"><strong>바이올린이 소리를 내는 방법과 공명시키는 방식 요약하기</strong></span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">~ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">등등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">전자 기타는 어떻게 소리를 낼까</span></strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>?</strong> : </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">기타 줄 밑에 픽업이 달려 있는데</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">자석에 코일이 감겨 있고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">현의 진동을 전기 신호로 바꿈</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">코일을 많이 감을수록 강한 신호를 만들어 냄</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">픽업에서 발생한 신호는 겨우 수 밀리 볼트에 불과</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">전기가 생겼다고 볼 수 없는 약한 신호이지만 백만 배 정도 증폭시키는 진공관 회로를 갖고 있는 앰프에 연결해 큰 소리를 냄</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">앰프가 전기기타의 공명체가 됨</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">11. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">찌그러진 호른은 어떻게 펴나</span></strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>?</strong> </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">자석과 쇠구슬을 이용하여 문질러서 점점 펴더라고요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">12. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">피디는 왜 마지막에 복원된 악기들로 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">오 솔레미오</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">오 나의 태양</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)’</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">를 연주곡으로 선택했을까요</span></strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>?</strong> : </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">악기들의 무덤에서 다시 태어나 태양을 보게 된</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">새 생명을 얻어서</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">??^^;; </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">마침 곡이 즐겁기도 하고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그랬을까요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">?^^ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">많고 많은 곡 중에 왜 이 곡이었는지 궁금했어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">그리고 듣다 보면 어느새 엇박자에 발이 움직이거나</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">몸이 들썩들썩하시는 걸 느끼실 수 있을 거예요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">저는 음악 들려줄 때 가끔 아이들의 발을 몰래몰래 본답니다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">자신도 모르는 사이에 맞추고 있거든요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">박자를요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">13. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">융합</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">악기 중에서도 각기 다른 음색을 잘 융합하는 악기가 있어요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">무엇일까요</span></strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>?</strong> <strong>나는 어떤 악기같나요?</strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">14. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">음악은 과학인가</span></strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><strong>?</strong> : </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 바탕;\">민음 바칼로레아 시리즈 책 제목이기도 해요</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">메르스 때문에 힘든 요즘... 건강관리 잘 하시고요... 힘내세요 샘들^^</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}